      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "梦境的内容，是目白阿尔丹\n从小到现在经历的种种苦难。\n是构成“现在”的她的原点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e7c02066faa467113f1ffe3f3450b2c1aa29f6b74b93a51cad269984b1db279",
