      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白阿尔丹从梦里清醒后，\n感觉到自己的历史之轮开始转动，\n于是重新打起精神前往训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cf1add9b22644af314bd0a843b3b538795a59e05eb9993a3b3e3249206a992c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
